------------------
{ printWidth: 80 }
------------------
- Markdown in a template:

  ```js
  const m = markdown`
    ~~~toml
    a = 1



    [b]
    ~~~

    ~~~yaml
    a: |
      x

      y
    ~~~
  `;
  ```

> Markup in a template:
>
> ```js
> const h = html`
>   <script type="importmap">
>     a
>
>
>     b
>   </script>
>   <script type="text/x-handlebars-template">
>     <p>{{a}}</p>
>   </script>
> `;
> ```

1. A block that is left alone:

   ```vue
   <custom>
   a
   
   
   
   b
   </custom>
   ```

   ```html
   <script type="text/unknown">
     a



     b
   </script>
   ```

